        {
          "title": "Reading: SELECT and FROM",
          "body": "`SELECT` names the columns you want and `FROM` names the table they come from.\n\n```sql\nSELECT name, city FROM customers;\n```\n\nUse `*` to ask for every column, but name them in real queries so a new column doesn't change your results."
        },
        {
          "title": "Filtering with WHERE",
          "videoUrl": "https://videos.example.com/sql/where",
