        },
        {
          "title": "Reading: sorting with ORDER BY",
          "body": "`ORDER BY` sorts the rows a query returns. Add `DESC` to reverse the order.\n\n```sql\nSELECT name FROM customers ORDER BY name DESC;\n```"
        }
